    "changes": "Uses the user-selected Marcel Porsiel exterior and its original feather images and UVs. Adds a bound seven-joint skeleton, continuous streamlined water posture, shorter bill and flippers, pink lower-bill and paler yellow vertex-color corrections. Two webbed feet remain visible. Walking uses alternating planted support; swimming uses paired stiff-flipper strokes followed by a glide. No display ground.",
